# Tooling & Workflow

- Start the dev environment with `pnpm dev` from the repo root (runs Turbo, cleans desktop `dist`, watches all packages).
- Build everything with `pnpm build` from the root.

## Formatting

- Biome is the single formatter/linter: single quotes, semicolons, trailing commas, 2-space indent.
- Do NOT introduce ESLint or Prettier config.
- Run `pnpm format` (or `pnpm check`) before committing.

## Before committing

- Run `pnpm format`.
- Ensure `pnpm build` passes with no type errors.
